# App Router

- Default to Server Components; add `'use client'` only for interactivity.
- Metadata in `layout.tsx` or page-level `export const metadata`.
- Use `@/*` import alias for internal modules.
- Client components: mobile nav, carousels, lightbox, scroll lock.
- Planned routes: `/`, `/servicios/[slug]`, `/galeria`, `/contacto`.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — content from config in server page
import { services } from '@/config/services';

// ❌ BAD — hardcoded copy in component
const title = 'Bodas y quinceañeras';
```
